.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Interface to the direct PARDISO solver from the MKL library\&. Derived from \fBSolver\fP class, following CSMP's strategy design pattern for the solution of linear algebraic systems of equations\&.

.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
works only if there is access to the MKL library\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBAuthor\fP
.RS 4
